==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Gigi is a red [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gashapon gachapon] with a dark red rim. Her eyes are half-closed with dark red eyelids and two eyelashes on each of the lower lids. The upper half of her head is a translucent, pale blue lid that can open up. She wears a cyan sweater with a darker neckline and a yellow star on the chest. The sleeves are long and oversized, covering her hands entirely. She has dark red legs and red feet.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Gigi is a medium gray, along with her feet. Meanwhile, her legs are a dark gray. The lid becomes a light gray, with the ridge and her eyelids being dark gray. The neckline and cuffs of her sleeves are a medium gray, with the star on her sweater now being black.
|-|Rainy Day=
Rainy Day Gigi is baby blue, with a similarly colored lid ridge as her default, while her eyelids are a dark cyan. Her sweater is replaced with a solid light yellow drawstring hoodie. White blush in the form of three or two lines are between her eyes and on her cheeks respectively. She also wears black tights and yellow rain boots.
|-|Snowball Fight=
Snowball Fight Gigi is alice blue along with her feet. The lid is a slightly more saturated blue than her default Skin, and is filled with seven snowballs. The ridge of her lid and her legs are sky blue. She has white circular blush on her cheeks. Her sweater's neckline and cuffs, along with her eyelids are goldenrod. It additionally has a pattern with a snowman, simplified snowflakes, and a gradient consisting of white, a bluish white, and sky blue, with white cloud-like patterns bordering the sleeve cuffs.
|-|Egg Thief=
Egg Thief Gigi is now a pastel pink, with her feet being the same color. Her lid is light blue and filled with five Easter eggs that have white and yellow patterns. Her lid's ridge, legs, and eyelids are orchid. She has white freckles in groups of three between her eyes and on her cheeks. Her sweater is pastel yellow, with a yellow neckline and cuffs. It also has two white zigzag patterns on both sleeves, and a largely white body with yellow dots.
|-|Wish Bear=
Wish Bear Gigi has the same skin color though she does also have two red rhombus markings on her cheeks. Her lid is light blue and filled with five yellow stars. She wears a sky blue, fluffy headband with bear ears, of which have white inner ears. Her sweater is a gradient from light blue mostly dark cyan, from back to sleeves, with the neckline and cuffs being darker. The neckline of her sweater is shaped more like the scruff of a furred animal, and it also has a light blue bear tail. She has gold-yellow pants with hearts and star patterns outlined with a lighter yellow. She also wears a yellow star backpack with a happy face and gold blush under its eyes.
|-|Cherry Obsidian=
Cherry Obsidian Gigi is cherry red with darker red hearts on her cheeks. The ridge of her lid and eyelids are a similar darker red, while the lid itself is a slightly pinkish dark red. Her sweater is black and has longer cuffs with various triangle shaped cuts, and a red teardrop shaped gem on the chest. She has a dark gray asymmetrical belt, with a dark red skirt that has a black and cherry red plaid pattern. She also white and dark gray striped tights. 
|-|Cute Collector=
Cute Collector Gigi is slightly more pinkish and has a small red blush beneath her eyes. She has cerulean colored shiny eyeshadow and her lid is a vibrant light blue, adorned with four stickers; a rainbow, light blue cloud, pink heart, and yellow star. Her sweater’s body is light blue with cerulean straight and squiggly stripes squiggly lines, while the sleeves are the same but with reversed colors. She has a white scarf wrapped around her neck, with a yellow star in the center of where it’s tied. She wears a barely visible white undershirt, baby pink skirt, along with white loose socks, with the left sock having baby pink stripes and the right one having yellow stripes.
|-|Golden Gacha=
Golden Gacha Gigi is a pale banana yellow, as are her feet. Her lid’s ridge and legs are goldenrod. The lid is filled with various gold bars and a crown, with a golden beaded bracelet hanging out of it, the crown and necklace both having red gems. She has golden shiny eyeshadow and pairs of golden rhombuses on her cheeks. Her sweater is now red, with the sleeves and a skirt being a lighter red. The neckline and cuffs are very poofy, white, and have red speckles. Two golden necklaces, one with a red gem, are worn around her neck, and two pieces of golden jewelry are attached to her sweater.
|-|Painted Brain=
Painted Brain Gigi is bicolored, partially a desaturated and slightly darker red, along with a bluish gray. The separations of which are marked with black stitches. She now has a more hungry looking grin, with sharp teeth and drool, and lacks differently colored eyelids. She wears a red spiked collar with white spikes. Her lid is baby pink, partially broken open, and has a pink brain within it. The lid’s ridge is banana yellow and has black zigzags along the entirety of it. Her sweater is bicolored, an off-black bluish color and a dark cherry red, separated with black stitches. Additionally, it is zipped up with a silver zipper.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Gigi is a friendly, excitable, and easily entertained Toon that tends to playfully tease others and talks in a casual tone. She is very acquisitive, constantly adding to her hoard by stealing or asking for the things of other Toons. Based on her interaction with {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}, she is very untidy due to how much stuff she has. She denies stealing things (and always prefers to call it "borrowing"), though she admits it when directly asked, as seen in her interactions with {{CI|Boxten|name=true}}, {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}, and {{CI|Astro|name=true}}. Despite this, she doesn't offer to give things back, and never agrees to stop stealing. 

Although she doesn't care for sharing, as shown in her interactions with {{CI|Eggson|name=true}}, and {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, she can be seen encouraging other Toons to get more stuff, offering to help {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, {{CI|Goob|name=true}}, and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}} with this. {{CI|Glisten|name=true}} calls her a bad liar. She is good friends with {{CI|Flutter|name=true}}, {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}, and {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, and enjoys doing activities with them.

She seems to be closest with Flutter, having gifted her a diary, designed it with her, keeping it for her, and writing in it for Flutter due to her wings. She's also excitedly discussed matching outfits with Flutter.

